  "details": "1. Open VRChat in the open beta\n\n2. Favorite enough worlds to have more than 10 worlds show up in \"Recently Updated Favorites\"\n\n3. View your Recently Updated Favorites tab\n\n4. Only ten worlds show up, but there is a scroll bar (even though that's not enough worlds to fill the visible area)\n\n5. Scroll the scroll bar\n\n6. More worlds load in in a glitchy sudden way, but they mostly load in higher-up where you can't see them after scrolling, meaning no matter how you scroll you mostly still only see those same 10 or so worlds.",
